config EXAMPLES_MTDTEST
	bool "mtdtest"
	default n
	depends on MTD
	---help---
		Enable mtdtest in TASH.  Erases, writes and verifies
		erase blocks of an FTL-backed MTD block device (default
		/dev/mtdblock7) to exercise the flash erase/program path.
		Writing to the partition that holds the running kernel, the
		OTA kernel slot or the boot parameters is refused unless
		forced.